*mouse_drop_action* ['swap|stack']::     Action performed when a bsp-managed window is dropped in the center of some other bsp-managed window.

*mouse_edge_resize* ['on|off']::     Enable or disable plain left-drag resize inside the 12px strip along a window edge when no 'mouse_modifier' is held. Defaults to 'off'.

*adaptive_resize* ['on|off']::     Enable or disable live BSP grid resize during mouse drag. When enabled, resizing a window in a bsp layout dynamically adjusts the split ratios of sibling windows in real time. When disabled (default), only the dragged window resizes during the drag; the bsp grid is reconciled against the final frame on mouse-up. Defaults to 'off'.

*focus_loop* ['on|off']::     Enable or disable wrap-around focus movement in scroll and accordion layouts. Defaults to 'on'.